# Ad-hoc scripts saved by run_sap_script(save_as=...) land directly in scripts/.
# Their auto-generated "# Result:" header embeds real model output (reactions,
# displacements, utilizations) and often absolute paths to client projects, so
# they are kept local. Reusable scripts belong in a scripts/<topic>/ subfolder,
# which this rule does not match. To commit one deliberately: git add -f <path>
scripts/*.py
